      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.12.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 12:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwezirikire okukunda; kandi mwetengyere kimwe ebiconco by'Omwoyo, kwonka okukira mwetengye okubuurira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orikugamba “orurimi” naaba atarikugambira bantu, kureka Ruhanga; ahabw'okuba tihaine orikubishoborokyerwa; kwonka we Omwoyo naaba naamugambisa enaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka orikubuurira naaba naagambira abantu eby'okubombeka n'okubeezirikisa n'okubahuumuriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orikugamba “orurimi” naaba naayeyombeka wenka; kwonka orikubuurira naaba naayombeka ekanisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.11.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 11:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mumanye ngu niinyenda ku mwena mugamba “endimi”, kwonka okukira ku mubuurira. Ahakuba obuurira akira ogamba “endimi”, kureka haagira owaazishoboorora, ngu ekanisa ebone kwombekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, ku ndiija owaanyu ningamba “endimi”, ndyabagasira ki, ku ndiba ntagambire ki naashuuruurirwa, nari eky'okumanya, nari eky'okubuurira, nari eky'okubeegyesa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nangwa n'ebintu ebigamba, ebitaine magara, nk'emikuri nari enanga, ku birikuba bitataaniise maraka gaabyo, baryamanya bata eki birikugamba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enzamba ku egamba eiraka eritarikwetegyerezibwa, n'oha oyeteekateeka kuza aha rugamba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu imwe, ku muraabe mutarikugamba mu “ndimi” ebigambo ebirikushobooroka, baryamanya bata ebirikugambwa? Ahakuba muryaba nimushusha nk'abarikugambira omuyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nsi yoona n'obu harimu endimi nyingi zita, tihariho na rumwe orutaine oku rushoboororwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mba ntashoborokyeirwe rurimi, mba nk'omunyamahanga ahari ogwo orikugamba, nawe ambeera atyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naimwe nk'oku mwine obweziriki aha biconco by'Omwoyo, mweshumbyeho okwezirika kwombeka ekanisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo orikugamba “orurimi”, ashabe kuheebwa okurushoboorora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba ku mba ninshaba omu “rurimi”, omwoyo gwangye gushaba, kwonka obwengye bwangye tibugira ki bukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 5:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu ngire nta? Niinyija kushabisa Omwoyo, kandi nshabise n'obwengye; niinyija kwehsongoza Omwoyo, kandi nyenshongoze n'obwengye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku oriba otatwarize otyo, haza waashabira omugisha omu Mwoyo wenka, omuntu ori aha rubaju rw'abatarikwetegyereza, aryaikiriza ara ati: Amiina, waaheza kusiima, haza we ataamanya ki waagamba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'amazima, ahabwawe nooba osiimire gye: kwonka ogwo we tarikuhwerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninsiima Ruhanga, ahakuba mwena nimbakiza kugamba “endimi”; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwonka omu kanisa omu mwanya gw'okugamba ebigambo kakumi “omu rurimi”, nkaayenzire kugamba ebigambo bitaano n'obwengye bwangye, ngu nyegyese abandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 4:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " B'eishe-emwe, mutaba abaana bato omu bwengye; kureka omu bibi mube abeereere, kwonka omu bwengye mube bakuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 28:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu Biragiro kikahandiikwa ngu: ndyagamba n'eihanga eri omu kanwa k'abantu abarikugamba endimi ezindi n'omu kanwa k'abanyamahanga; kwonka, n'obu ndigamba ntyo, tibarimpurira, nikwo Mukama arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo “endimi” n'akamanyiso aha batarikwikiriza, ti ha barikwikiriza; kwonka okubuurira n'akamanyiso aha barikwikiriza, ti ha batarikwikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekanisa yoona ku yakauba eteeraine, boona baagamba “endimi”, ku haakutaahamu abatarikushoborokyerwa nari abatarikwikiriza? tibakaagira ngu mugwire eiraro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka boona ku baakuba nibabuurira, kandi omuntu otarikwikiriza nari otarikushoborokyerwa ku yaakutaahamu, akaahanwa boona, kandi acwerwa boona orubanja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 45:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " enaama z'omu mutima gwe zishuuruurwa, abona kujuumara ahansi n'okuramya Ruhanga naahamya ati: Buzima kwo Ruhanga ari omuriimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu, B'eishe-emwe, biri bita? Ku muteerana, buri muntu areeta ekye, omwe areeta zaaburi, ondiijo eky'okwegyesa, ondiijo eki ashuuruuriirwe, ondiijo “orurimi”, n'ondiijo eky'okushoboorora. Byona bigume bikorwe ahabw'okwombeka abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku haraabe haabaireho abarikugamba “endimi”, hagambe babiri, kutarenga ahari bashatu, kandi bagambe omu mbu; habeho n'ow'okubishoboorora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku haraabe hatariho ow'okushoboorora, orikugamba “orurimi” ahuname omu kanisa, abigambe n'omutima gwe, kandi abigambire Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TH.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tes 5:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ababuurizi bagambe babiri nari bashatu, abandi babyetegyereze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku haraabe hariho oshutami, yaashuuruurirwa ekigambo, owaaba naagamba ahuname. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba mwena nimubaasa kubuurira omwe omwe, ngu boona babone kwega, n'okwezirikisana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyoyo ya baanabi etegyekwa baanabi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba Ruhanga ti Ruhanga w'okujagarara, kureka n'ow'obusingye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
